{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792183200, "covers_from": "2026-10-16T20:40:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-16T20:41:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792183260, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-16T20:40:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 41046, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "環境", "content": "我希望台北市不要成為不可愛米奇的樂園🐭", "display_name": "北投代表 No.41,046", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-16T20:40:06+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 13592, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "為什麼腳踏車要跟行人擠人行道，在人行道都要被腳踏車按鈴，一直增加ubike 就造成這個狀況", "display_name": "文山代表 No.13,592", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-16T20:40:20+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 9584, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "文山區興隆路一段，不僅路不平坑坑洞洞，紅綠燈不在斑馬線上，很多彎道沒紅綠燈確有斑馬線，綠燈時很危險", "display_name": "文山代表 No.9,584", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-16T20:40:35+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 19181, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "育兒", "content": "建議公幼及非營利幼兒園抽籤規則比照公托，特殊生固定名額數，一般生才有機會唸公幼及非營利。", "display_name": "信義代表 No.19,181", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-16T20:40:49+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 47291, "sprite_key": "penguin_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "育兒", "content": "我今天吃的營養午餐的菜很苦，我媽說是因為菜沒洗乾淨還有農藥", "display_name": "文山代表 No.47,291", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 13592, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.13,592", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 9584, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.9,584", "district": "wenshan", "is